      "architecture_pattern": "monolith",
      "lessons": [
        "Uses ReScript/ReasonML for frontend type safety and compiled-to-JavaScript approach rather than TypeScript, indicating emphasis on correctness and functional programming paradigms",
        "Implements GraphQL as primary API layer between Rails backend and ReScript frontend, enabling flexible client-side queries and strong schema validation",
        "Monorepo structure with Lerna workspaces for frontend packages suggests modular component architecture while maintaining single codebase for coordinated updates",
        "Rich markdown processing pipeline with 11+ markdown-it plugins indicates sophisticated content rendering for educational materials (task descriptions, feedback, collaborative notes)"
